<![CDATA[<font face="arial" size="3">We are happy that you are a National Funding customer, and hope that you feel the same way. &nbsp;We wanted to ask you a few short questions about your experience so that we can continue to improve our service.</font><div><br><font face="arial">We would appreciate your sharing any feedback you have in our anonymous <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/customer-feedback/">1-minute survey</a>.<br><br>If there are issues that have arisen that need to be resolved, we want to help, so please email us at info@nationalfunding.com.</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial"><div>Thank you for your time,</div><div><br></div><div>The team at National Funding</div></font></div>]]></td>
